  "title": "The Wonderful Wizard of Oz - Colophon (Fragment 1)",
  "text": "The Wonderful Wizard of Oz was published in 1900 by L. Frank Baum.\n\nThis ebook was produced for Standard Ebooks by Michael Atkinson, and is based on a transcription produced in 1993 by Distributed Proofreaders for Project Gutenberg and on digital scans from the Internet Archive.\n\nThe cover page is adapted from Heroic Landscape with Rainbow, a painting completed in 1824 by Joseph Anton Koch. The cover and title pages feature the League Spartan and Sorts Mill Goudy typefaces created in 2014 and 2009 by The League of Moveable Type.\n\nThis edition was released on August 15, 2026, 5:39 p.m. and is based on revision 2874632. The first edition of this ebook was released on December 12, 2018, 11:08 p.m. You can check for updates to this ebook, view its revision history, or download it for different ereading systems at standardebooks.org/ebooks/l-frank-baum/the-wonderful-wizard-of-oz.\n\nThe volunteer-driven Standard Ebooks project relies on readers like you to submit typos, corrections, and other improvements. Anyone can contribute at standardebooks.org.",
